  <summary>A desktop client for Jellyfin</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Bloom plays the films, shows and music on your Jellyfin server in a native window, decoding
    video on your graphics card through mpv. It has a full player, downloads that play with no
    server, several servers and accounts, custom themes and a command palette.</p>
    <p>Bloom is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Jellyfin project.</p>
  </description>
